\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Standing At The Portal
\par Of the opening year,
\par Words of comfort meet us,
\par Hushing every fear,
\par Spoken through the silence
\par By our Father's voice,
\par Tender, strong, and faithful,
\par Making us rejoice.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward, then, and fear not,
\par Children of the day!
\par For His word shall never,
\par Never pass away!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I, the Lord, am with thee,
\par Be thou not afraid!
\par I will help and strengthen,
\par Be thou not dismayed!
\par Yea, I will uphold thee
\par With my own right hand
\par Thou art called and chosen
\par In My sight to stand.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward, then, and fear not,
\par Children of the day!
\par For His word shall never,
\par Never pass away!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. For the year before us,
\par O what rich supplies!
\par For the poor and needy
\par Living streams shall rise;
\par For the sad and sinful
\par Shall His grace abound,
\par For the faint and feeble
\par Perfect strength be found.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward, then, and fear not,
\par Children of the day!
\par For His word shall never,
\par Never pass away!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 4. He will never fail us,
\par He will not forsake;
\par His eternal covenant
\par He will never break!
\par Resting on His promise,
\par What have we to fear?
\par God is all- sufficient
\par For the coming year.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward, then, and fear not,
\par Children of the day!
\par For His word shall never,
\par Never pass away!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

